        "Proposed extractor design: one binding-based classifier on `oxc_semantic`, a single typed peel function with no catch-all match arms, `ComponentMapping` built only from evidence, and a `decide.rs` registry plus an architecture test banning catch-all arms and name literals outside it.",
        "Shared-state audit (origin/main f4a88f93): 4 High, 4 Medium, 10 Low issues, all found by code reading only, not reproduced.",
        "Degraded results (checker timeouts/crashes, failed dependency-file reads) get cached as authoritative answers; proposed fix is to mark degraded results so no cache stores them.",
